/*
Owning product/workflow: Zoho CRM / Form 1 assisted request issuance.
Trigger: Unbound Administrator-restricted Leads record-details button template.
Input: lead_id is retained only as the future caller contract; no record is read.
Authentication: no Connection or route is used while issuance is disabled.
Idempotency: no token, session, intake identity, or external write is created.
Failure behavior: fail closed locally and never open a URL.
Logging: coarse outcome names only; never log IDs, bodies, URLs, headers, or errors.
Rollback: keep the button unbound and preserve the disabled template.
*/

if(input.lead_id != null && input.lead_id.toString().matches("^[1-9][0-9]{9,29}$"))
{
	info "form1_assisted_issue_disabled";
}
else
{
	info "form1_issue_rejected";
}
